Description:
    Enable experimental role-based access control. Turns on config.rbac,
    writes config/initializers/rbac.rb (system roles), defines rbac_holder
    on ResourcePolicy from --holders, includes Plutonium::Rbac::Holder in
    each holder model and
    Plutonium::Rbac::Policy in the base policy, and connects the role
    resource to a portal.

Usage:
    rails g pu:rbac:install --holders=HOLDER [HOLDER...] [options]

Options:
    --holders=HOLDER...       Models that hold roles. Use Class:association for a
                              membership scoped to a tenant (OrganizationUser:organization);
                              it gets `def rbac_entity = association`. A bare
                              class (User) holds roles outside any tenant.
    --policy=CLASS            Policy class that receives Plutonium::Rbac::Policy
                              (default: ResourcePolicy)
    --user-association=NAME   Association from a membership holder to the user
                              (default: user)
    --dest=DESTINATION        Portal that gets the role resource (main_app or a portal package)
    --skip-portal             Do not connect the role resource to a portal

Examples:
    # Memberships hold roles inside an organization, users outside it
    rails g pu:rbac:install --holders=OrganizationUser:organization User --dest=org_portal

    # Enable now, connect a portal later
    rails g pu:rbac:install --holders=OrganizationUser:organization --skip-portal

Generated Files:
    config/initializers/rbac.rb
    [packages/portal/]app/controllers/[portal/]rbac_roles_controller.rb

What Gets Modified:
    config/initializers/plutonium.rb   config.rbac.enabled = true
    Holder models                      include Plutonium::Rbac::Holder
    Policy class                       include Plutonium::Rbac::Policy
    app/policies/resource_policy.rb    def rbac_holder (always this file)
    Portal routes                      register_resource ::Plutonium::Rbac::Role

After Generation:
    1. rails db:migrate
    2. rails plutonium:rbac:sync
